WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.488
Open a recorded event to see the details behind
the activity.

00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:08.058
Use filters when you need to narrow the history.

00:00:08.058 --> 00:00:12.316
The ledger distinguishes recorded outcomes from
work still waiting.

00:00:12.316 --> 00:00:19.154
Sample records illustrate the interface here; no
external messages, payments, or bids were sent.
